        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从东京的亚军，到大阪的冠军。双打世界第一西尼亚科娃，拿下生涯第六座巡回赛单打冠军。你对她的印象，更多来自单打，还是双打？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "11796763a788f1a46d7121420efb9aaf28291fdb3ffdc9513b67859579d92cf7",
      "words_sha256": "9d738a10940372597f56c5ccdc2a625607830c7df2ca746a9fd451e4fcd189c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8751ed6ed4c560e5e73bfa43f23953ac245788edcc00187aa1989a4bc4d0c4dd",
      "request_id": "8751ed6ed4c560e5e73bfa43f23953ac245788edcc00187aa1989a4bc4d0c4dd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "dbb04442549ea31e38f8b74c459c04c2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京时间十月二十五日中午，大阪站女单决赛。二零一六年，她在这项赛事的东京决赛落败。十年后，西尼亚科娃只丢一局，拿下冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f0a5e3cd414efab66dffc5ab3c71b69d7dd813758d98881d2aa0a30d76e1b7f4",
      "words_sha256": "b156081bc8dd0760b1e66154d34f489937048e1aff649cd4f69c36d1fd3c7d89"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9550f89baaab8682155eed2352d74ab6c424892661db81bc7548ac1a7af28b34",
      "request_id": "9550f89baaab8682155eed2352d74ab6c424892661db81bc7548ac1a7af28b34",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ed221fe87e730ef162b9ccc238f1bb1c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛最后一分，西尼亚科娃发球后回到底线，和布尔特继续相持。赢下这一分，她就能再进决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "640951bc7c1ae4bb75124d297011ec1f78c02548da53d29bd8d075cbf9c86f40",
      "words_sha256": "a0136122f52958673a38cf7e154081dcc343b847b3c871100bf793e4ed15083c"
    },
    {
