        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从第二轮到半决赛，她先后击败林内特、斯托亚纳和布尔特。三场比赛，六盘全赢。再往前一步，就是冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c8de16a91bc306f710f5732fa8d1e88e5881cc10b807628d204e51c7b9b8d774",
      "words_sha256": "3e7dcb3bfc69815ea7492a7719fe5d30eb18578c1ed1e2963e9d66e634ad15d6"
    },
    {
